### Mechanic: Mallet Swing & Launch
INTENT: Detects mallet swing input, applies angular impulse to the lever, and triggers puck launch via ApplyImpulse when peak tension is reached.
PSEUDO:
  if MidwayInput.IsActionDown("fire") then
    ApplyImpulse(mallet_handle, 0, -10, 0)
    swing_timer = timer + dt
    if swing_timer > TENSION_THRESHOLD then
      ApplyAngularImpulse(lever_handle, 0, 0, MAX_TORQUE)
      ApplyImpulse(puck_handle, 0, LAUNCH_FORCE, 0)
      swing_timer = 0
    end
  end
API:
