### Mechanic: Echo Strikes rhythm
INTENT: The player must time swings to hit the same target zone consecutively to build an echo counter and unlock rhythm-based rewards.
PSEUDO:
  if IsActionDown("fire") then
    ApplyImpulse(mallet, 0, -swing_force, 0)
  end
  if IsSensorTriggered(bell) then
    hit_zone = GetPosition(puck).z
    if hit_zone ~= last_hit_zone then
      echo_counter = 0
    else
      echo_counter = echo_counter + 1
      if echo_counter >= 3 then
        Engine.AwardTickets(echo_counter * 10, "Echo Bonus")
        echo_counter = 0
      end
    end
    last_hit_zone = hit_zone
  end
